Document Purpose
This document is the single authoritative procedural framework for bringing SignalGate Pulse to production readiness. It synthesizes the Architecture Contract, all requirements identified during active development sessions, direct code inspection of the live consumer-v1 branch, and the complete governance model for future releases.
SignalGate Pulse is the consumer-facing fork. Its philosophy: set-and-forget protection — silent, correct, zero daily management. But set-and-forget until you need it: every decision must be auditable, reversible, and surfaced on demand.
Pulse and Multi-Port are separate standalone applications sharing no live code dependency.
Reading requirement: Before editing any file in this project, read Architecture-Contract.md in full. Non-negotiable regardless of tool or session context.



