PendingCardEntity fields: id, phoneNumber, timestamp, decision, confidence, decisionSource, dismissed (Boolean). Distinct from CallLogEntry: CallLogEntry is permanent audit; PendingCardEntity is a short-lived queue deleted on card dismissal.

Critical schema constraint: UnifiedEntryEntity.sourceId is non-nullable with a foreign key to SourceEntity. Two dedicated source rows must be seeded at first install: (1) MANUAL — for user-created block/allow rules, priority 100. (2) Contacts Allow List — for contact imports, priority 100. Both must be checked before insert, never blindly inserted.


