Must NOT be a parallel data system to DataSourceRepository.
UnifiedEntryDao already provides: findUnifiedAllowEntry(), findUnifiedBlockEntry(), getAllBlockPatterns(), deleteEntry(), insertEntry() — the repository is a thin facade over these.
All inserts use the MANUAL sourceId from Step 1.1.
Expose: addBlockRule(phoneNumber), removeBlockRule(phoneNumber), addAllowRule(phoneNumber), removeAllowRule(phoneNumber), queryByNumber(phoneNumber), getAllUserRules() (for data export to Multi-Port).
Register in Koin repositoryModule.
Deliverable: BlocklistRepository.kt with block/allow CRUD via UnifiedEntryDao using the MANUAL sourceId.

